## Toolbox
You have three types of tools. **Status tags:** `[preloaded]` = ready at startup, `[loaded]` = loaded this session, `[unloaded]` = call `load_func`/`load_skill`/`load_cli` first.
- **Skills** — Instruction documents. Not callable via the API. Follow the SKILL.md instructions.
- **CLI tools** — Shell command definitions. Not callable via the API. Execute via `{{ shell_tool }}`.
- **Func tools** — Callable functions via the API function-calling interface. `[preloaded]` and `[loaded]` schemas are included in API definitions.

